{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/850912-lairs-questions-concerns","id":850912,"title":"Lairs - Questions & Concerns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-21T18:52:57-07:00","id":850912,"title":"Lairs - Questions & Concerns","content":"How do lairs work exactly? I've read the public pdf and I am still somewhat confused. The lair is a dream like stasis. But one can invite others to it. Basically - I am clueless in regards to how the lair system works. Any sort of guidance would be appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T20:01:07-07:00","id":850937,"title":"","content":"The Primordial Dream, like the Astral Realms as a whole, is essentially another dimension that most people interact with through dreams and meditation. Beasts are one of a handful of entity-types with the dubious distinction of being able to open physical connections to the place, since their Lair is a part of it connected to their Horror.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T12:10:39-07:00","id":851270,"title":"","content":"The lair is part of the astral space which are essentially an other dimension. A part of the astral realms are called the Temenos which represents the collective unconsciousness of mankind - which includes of course the fears of man called the primordial dream. As the beasts are spawned from those fears they are connected to this region of the astral space and have their lair located in it. This connection allows them to drag normal people which are dreaming into their lairs, which I think is where you got the idea that it is a dream-like state. However, unlike normal people beasts (and mages) can also on their own power enter the astral space, especially their lairs. Thus for the beasts it their lairs are another dimension over which they have full control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10574-matthiasthalmann","name":"MatthiasThalmann","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}